    "notes": "Take 4's own clean opening (lines 1-4, before its first extend seam), then one new shot per line or action, each started from a still of Take 4: no extends, so no seams and no slow motion. PERSONALLY! is its own one-word take, voiced over an insert of his palm landing flat on the hood; the second thump rings on into the medium close-up. The doors close! is laid from the lines take over an insert of his hand shutting the door, so the thunk lands right after close!. A real 1.0 s held pause before Wheels!, then a 1 s freeze. Graphics are Take 4's full-frame PNGs, each landing on its word, with HAND-INSPECTED! cleared before the pat and DOORS CLOSE! raised over the door's windows. Every shot's whole sound (its own audio and what is laid into it) is faded 12 ms at both ends, so no audio cut clicks. Ported from hal5/edit.mjs. PERSONALLY! and The doors close! are lines carrying their own stretch of their takes, laid into the pat and the door as layers of those shots' sound, as the script mixed them."
